It allowed the Italian working class and lower middle class

27
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:11,920
of Brooklyn an escape route to the suburbs.

28
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:13,720
That escape route was the Verrazano Bridge,

29
00:02:13,820 --> 00:02:15,720
